# Vortx Glassmorphic UI Protection

The approved Vortx website UI is a dark glassmorphic institutional interface. Do not replace it with a plain flat Tailwind layout, default SaaS cards, or a different visual system unless the user explicitly asks to redesign the UI.

Required visual language:

- Preserve `glass-panel`, `display-font`, `data-font`, terminal blue/green accents, metallic borders, black translucent panels, backdrop blur, and subtle grid/radial backgrounds.
- Keep the premium public-record intelligence tone: institutional, minimal, dark, data-forward, and easy on the eyes.
- New marketing/sales sections must be integrated into the existing glass style instead of changing the overall layout language.
- Do not reintroduce broken production-bundle rollback behavior or stale asset references. Main deploys should build from `frontend/src` unless the user explicitly asks for a bundle rollback.
- Before deploying UI changes, run `npm run typecheck` in `frontend/`, verify generated JS/CSS assets are not HTML, and confirm `https://vortxmkt.com` is not blank.

If a task requires functional UI additions, add them inside the glassmorphic system and call out any unavoidable visual deviation before deploying.
